    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on a journey in another world... by typing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isekat: Crushed by a Computer, My Beloved Kitten is Transported to a Fantasy World where its Typing Skills Save the Kingdom!</strong> is a <strong>typing game</strong> where you play the role of an unfortunate kitten from our world who unexpectedly dies and wakes up in a fantasy world of swords, magic and anthromorphic animal people!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bird. Reptile. Dog. Cat</strong>. Long ago, the four animal kingdoms lived together in harmony. But everything changed when the Dog Kingdom attacked. Beset on all sides, their catpeople captured, and the crown prince catnapped, the Cat Kingdom is forced to resort to dire measures... <i>Summoning a hero from another world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armed with a magical laptop-like relic</strong>, the instinctive affinity of a cat with keyboards, and <i>your typing fingers</i>, you venture forth as a kitten, the one sole hope of the Cat Kingdom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f| Fight Enemies, Conquer Dungeons!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737990/extras/dbe9f14302ce6f207927443c971c1475.poster.avif?t=1753900625\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737990/extras/dbe9f14302ce6f207927443c971c1475.webm?t=1753900625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737990/extras/dbe9f14302ce6f207927443c971c1475.mp4?t=1753900625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A test of your typing skills (and your clackiness of your keyboard)!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dungeon, you do everything with the keyboard: Attack, block, avoid traps, open chests...\u00a0Can your keyboard keep up?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race the clock!</strong> Fight your way through the dungeon to rescue the hostages in time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed is key!</strong> Type the words before you as quickly as you can!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time your blocks!</strong> Fight different kinds of enemies, each with their own attack patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737990/extras/fcdb3909cb444612970092a21b3b40a2.avif?t=1753900625\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc7f| Defeat bosses!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war rages on under orders of the lords of the Dog, Bird and Reptile Kingdoms. Take them down to end the war once and for all! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be careful: they don't fight fair!</strong> Each fight will push your typing skills to the absolute limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737990/extras/33a014886ca0a21c968d8fa4a5bd956a.avif?t=1753900625\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd17<strong>| Meet comrades, build friendships, make allies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure, your kitten can only communicate via <strong>Text-to-Speech</strong>, but that doesn't make the bonds you form any less real!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend a colorful cast of animal people from every corner of the land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Band together in your fight against the enemy kingdoms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737990/extras/73e445a05577022c114fc43022806a51.avif?t=1753900625\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d| Rebuild the Kingdom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebuilding is necessary, but it isn't free!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather Catnip</strong> to pay off the scraggly <strong>Bobcat the Builder</strong> for his construction services!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring the rescued cat people home!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the eternal gratitude of the people as they rally to help you in any way they can!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We're all counting on you, little hero!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on a journey in another world... by typing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isekat: Crushed by a Computer, My Beloved Kitten is Transported to a Fantasy World where its Typing Skills Save the Kingdom!</strong> is a <strong>typing game</strong> where you play the role of an unfortunate kitten from our world who unexpectedly dies and wakes up in a fantasy world of swords, magic and anthromorphic animal people!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bird. Reptile. Dog. Cat</strong>. Long ago, the four animal kingdoms lived together in harmony. But everything changed when the Dog Kingdom attacked. Beset on all sides, their catpeople captured, and the crown prince catnapped, the Cat Kingdom is forced to resort to dire measures... <i>Summoning a hero from another world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armed with a magical laptop-like relic</strong>, the instinctive affinity of a cat with keyboards, and <i>your typing fingers</i>, you venture forth as a kitten, the one sole hope of the Cat Kingdom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f| Fight Enemies, Conquer Dungeons!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737990/extras/dbe9f14302ce6f207927443c971c1475.poster.avif?t=1753900625\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737990/extras/dbe9f14302ce6f207927443c971c1475.webm?t=1753900625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737990/extras/dbe9f14302ce6f207927443c971c1475.mp4?t=1753900625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A test of your typing skills (and your clackiness of your keyboard)!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dungeon, you do everything with the keyboard: Attack, block, avoid traps, open chests...\u00a0Can your keyboard keep up?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race the clock!</strong> Fight your way through the dungeon to rescue the hostages in time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed is key!</strong> Type the words before you as quickly as you can!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time your blocks!</strong> Fight different kinds of enemies, each with their own attack patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737990/extras/fcdb3909cb444612970092a21b3b40a2.avif?t=1753900625\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc7f| Defeat bosses!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war rages on under orders of the lords of the Dog, Bird and Reptile Kingdoms. Take them down to end the war once and for all! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be careful: they don't fight fair!</strong> Each fight will push your typing skills to the absolute limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737990/extras/33a014886ca0a21c968d8fa4a5bd956a.avif?t=1753900625\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd17<strong>| Meet comrades, build friendships, make allies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure, your kitten can only communicate via <strong>Text-to-Speech</strong>, but that doesn't make the bonds you form any less real!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend a colorful cast of animal people from every corner of the land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Band together in your fight against the enemy kingdoms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737990/extras/73e445a05577022c114fc43022806a51.avif?t=1753900625\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d| Rebuild the Kingdom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebuilding is necessary, but it isn't free!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather Catnip</strong> to pay off the scraggly <strong>Bobcat the Builder</strong> for his construction services!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring the rescued cat people home!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the eternal gratitude of the people as they rally to help you in any way they can!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We're all counting on you, little hero!</strong></p>",
